  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "枚举二进制位",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": "枚举所有为 1 的位（$O(popcount(x))$）",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "cpp",
              "code": "for (int t = x; t; t &= t - 1) {      // t & (t-1)：消掉最低位的 1\n\tint i = __builtin_ctz(t);          // 最低位 1 的下标（0-based）\n\t// 处理第 i 位\n}",
              "depth": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "p",
              "html": "原理：<code>t &amp; (t-1)</code> 每次把最低位的 1 清零（等价 <code>t - lowbit(t)</code>），ctz 一条指令（bsf/tzcnt）直接给出下标；x 有几个 1 就跑几轮，与位宽无关",
              "depth": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "lowbit（取最低位 1）",
          "level": 3,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "cpp",
              "code": "int lowbit(int x) { return x & -x; }  // 例：lowbit(12) = 4",
              "depth": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "内置函数全家桶（GCC/Clang）",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<code>__builtin_popcount(x)</code>：二进制中 1 的个数",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<code>__builtin_clz(x)</code>：前导 0 的个数（x = 0 未定义）",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<code>__builtin_ctz(x)</code>：末尾 0 的个数（x = 0 未定义）",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<code>__builtin_ffs(x)</code>：最低位 1 的下标 + 1（1-based；x = 0 返回 0）",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<code>floor(log2 x) = 31 - __builtin_clz(x)</code>（x > 0，int 下）",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "long long 版本：<code>__builtin_popcountll</code> / <code>__builtin_clzll</code> / <code>__builtin_ctzll</code> / <code>__builtin_ffsll</code>",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "枚举子集 / 状压 DP：见 <a href=\"/k/状态压缩\" class=\"wikilink\">状态压缩</a>",
          "depth": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "常用位运算技巧",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "判断 2 的幂：<code>x &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; !(x &amp; (x - 1))</code>",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "第 k 位操作（0-based）：",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "cpp",
          "code": "(x >> k) & 1    // 取第 k 位\nx | (1 << k)    // 置 1\nx & ~(1 << k)   // 清 0\nx ^ (1 << k)    // 翻转",
          "depth": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "向上取整到 2 的幂：",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "cpp",
          "code": "int next_pow2(int x) {          // x >= 1\n\treturn 1 << (32 - __builtin_clz(x - 1));\n}",
          "depth": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "注意 x = 1 时 x-1 = 0，clz(0) 未定义，需特判",
          "depth": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "注意",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "<code>==</code> 优先级高于 <code>&amp;</code>：判断奇偶必须写 <code>(x &amp; 1) == 0</code>，不能省括号",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "ctz(0)、clz(0) 未定义，循环条件写成 t 就天然避开",
          "depth": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "html": "内置函数最好传无符号类型（有符号负数的行为是实现相关）",
          "depth": 2
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
